      "id": "claim_38c493daf5fb4d14add2047decddaa0b",
      "statement": "backend/app/agent/tools/sql/catalog.py is the allowlist of tables and columns Ask's SQL tool may read; at boot `_verify_sql_catalog` raises RuntimeError if the catalog drifts from the database (e.g. a catalogued table missing), while undeclared database tables are only logged and stay invisible to the agent until catalogued or excluded.",
