    {
      "id": "claim_829dda1126d7485c954db54928324634",
      "statement": "Agents are built lazily: lifespan opens the pool, verifies the SQL catalog, opens the checkpointer and registers the /agent, /ingest and /proposal routes at boot, while load_agents builds all three agents together once under a lock on the first post to any of those routes (or the first REST route calling get_graph); Ask has exactly seven tools, with compare_fit the only one using fixed rather than model-written SQL.",
