    {
      "id": "claim_83d260bc61334b3886c8449627c2e9f5",
      "statement": "`make evals` runs the golden questions through the real agent on the host venv backend/.venv with --run-evals, so it makes paid model calls: about 10 cents a case, except the `cost` cases (about $0.90 a run), which a run with no TAG includes. TAG=canary selects the cheap subset, TAG=import the Import canaries, and K=<name> one case. Unit tests never touch a database: they use a router-only app with a sentinel pool that raises on any use.",
