      "id": "claim_b1662939628543f1a0f188c0f78188b2",
      "statement": "CLAUDE.md remains the source of repo invariants and commands, and its Read first section names openwiki/ (starting at quickstart.md), docs/ARCHITECTURE.md (rules and decisions) and docs/CHANGELOG.md (what shipped). AGENTS.md is a pointer that sends agents to CLAUDE.md first and names the same three. The OpenWiki wiki is optional just-in-time context: agents use openwiki_search/openwiki_read only when needed and fall back to openwiki/quickstart.md only when retrieval tools are unavailable, with source code and tests authoritative.",
