      "id": "claim_7db8c2ebe8e141618ae910ada06322ad",
      "statement": "The backend runs three agents, each on its own AG-UI route registered in lifespan: Ask on /agent, Import (Scout) on /ingest and Proposal Copilot (Sangam Pitch) on /proposal. AGENT_ACCESS declares who may post to each (ask_access; require_scout plus chat_access; proposal_chat_access), and a path with no entry fails at boot.",
