    {
      "id": "claim_e71d61b1972a495ea2950cdfc37890b0",
      "statement": "Proposal Copilot is the third deep agent: code in backend/app/proposals/ owns steps, gates, facts and checks, and the agent only proposes. Its state lives in proposals.work (migration 0048), and every write, from REST or agent, goes through work.apply inside repositories.proposals.save, which locks the row with SELECT ... FOR UPDATE. The agent has nine tools of its own plus read_file, and no SQL tool.",
