    {
      "id": "claim_fed1f585903e405c8a71beded9a3967c",
      "statement": "CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml) runs on every PR and push to master and deploys nothing: jobs are ruff lint, unit tests with coverage (-m \"not integration\"), integration tests against a fresh pgvector Postgres after baseline, migrate and seed (two preserved-dump tests deselected), and the frontend lint, tsc and build. Coverage goes to Codecov, where codecov.yml fails a PR that lowers project coverage by more than 1% or covers under 70% of changed lines. Evals are not run in CI.",
